            <h3>Appointment Availability & Booking Tips</h3>
            <p>BLS London is very busy—appointments fill quickly. To maximize your chances:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Book early:</strong> Create your BLS account and reserve a slot at least 4–6 weeks in advance.</li>
                <li><strong>Off-peak months:</strong> September–November and January–February have fewer applicants and more availability.</li>
