                <li><strong>Passport:</strong> Valid for at least 18 months beyond your intended stay in Spain.</li>
                <li><strong>ACRO Certificate:</strong> Criminal record check issued by the UK's Disclosure and Barring Service (DBS). Order online at disclosure.org.uk.</li>
                <li><strong>HMRC Tax Documents:</strong> Either a Certificate of Residence/Tax Return from HMRC or a recent tax year assessment. Request via the HMRC online portal.</li>
                <li><strong>Bank Statements:</strong> 6 months of recent statements from a UK bank showing consistent income and balance (minimum €2,300/month).</li>
                <li><strong>Employment Contract or Client Agreement:</strong> If self-employed, a copy of your contract with clients or a letter from your employer.</li>
                <li><strong>Health Insurance Documentation:</strong> Proof of comprehensive health insurance valid in Spain (see Insurance section).</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Apostille Requirements (UK Documents)</h3>
            <p>The following UK documents must have an <strong>apostille</strong> (UK government certification):</p>
            <ul>
                <li>ACRO Certificate (criminal record)</li>
                <li>HMRC Certificate of Residence (if applicable)</li>
                <li>Diplomas or educational certificates (if you have them)</li>
                <li>UK-issued marriage or birth certificates (if applicable)</li>
            </ul>

            <p><strong>How to get UK apostilles:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>For ACRO certificates: The DBS automatically apostilles DBS-issued documents. Request the apostilled version when ordering.</li>
                <li>For HMRC documents: Submit to the <strong>FCDO Apostille Office, Hanslope Park, Northampton NN4 0EF</strong> or apply online via the UK government apostille service.</li>
                <li><strong>Processing time:</strong> 3–5 working days for UK apostilles.</li>
                <li><strong>Cost:</strong> £30–40 per document.</li>
